# swing-gates.xrs - the motion sword (VR-37): a swing must do NOTHING while the
# game is not asking for one, and must say which gate stopped it.
#
# Needs the same as swing-edge.xrs: a loaded level in GAMEPLAY, GamepadOnly=0.
# Run:  .\tools\xrsim-run.ps1 -Path .\tools\xrsim\swing-gates.xrs
#
# Each leg swings the same 0.68 m in 200 ms (about 5 m/s, well over the 3.6
# threshold) and expects ONE `swing: BLOCKED` line naming the gate, and no FIRE.
# The last leg opens every gate and expects the FIRE, so a sequence that passes
# because the detector is simply dead cannot pass.

hand r to grip 0.25 1.30 -0.40 0 0 0 1200
@wait 1500
trigger r pull 300
@wait 2500
@mod swing on; swing mode edge; swing threshold 3.6; swing sword on; swing force off; swing output rt
@wait 1000

# 1. The right grip is held: that is block, and a blocking arm is not attacking.
@mark
grip r squeeze 2500
@wait 500
hand r to grip -0.35 1.00 -0.45 0 0 0 200
@log swing: BLOCKED .* a grip is held
@wait 800
@nolog swing: FIRE
@nolog swing: BLOCKED
@wait 2500

# 1b. The left grip opens the power wheel, which the mod already counts as a UI
#     surface: picking off the wheel moves the hand fast and must not swing.
@mark
grip l squeeze 2500
@wait 700
hand r to grip 0.25 1.30 -0.40 0 0 0 200
@log swing: BLOCKED .* not a gameplay view
@wait 800
@nolog swing: FIRE
@wait 2500
hand r to grip -0.35 1.00 -0.45 0 0 0 1200
@wait 1500

# 2. The pause menu is up.
@mark
@key Escape
@wait 2000
hand r to grip 0.25 1.30 -0.40 0 0 0 200
@log swing: BLOCKED .* not a gameplay view
@nolog swing: FIRE
@key Escape
@wait 3000

# 3. The sword is sheathed (hold Use). The attack input would DRAW it, which is
#    not what a swing of an empty hand should do.
@mark
btn x press 1500
@wait 3500
@modassert features.swing.closedBy ne open
hand r to grip -0.35 1.00 -0.45 0 0 0 200
@log swing: BLOCKED .* the sword is not in the right hand
@nolog swing: FIRE
@wait 1500

# 4. Every gate open again: the same swing fires. Draw the sword first.
trigger r pull 300
@wait 2500
@mark
hand r to grip 0.25 1.30 -0.40 0 0 0 200
@log swing: FIRE #\d+ slash
@log swing: HONOURED slash
